/*
 * SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
 *
 * This board has no modem wired up by default. Each externally-wired modem
 * this project supports gets its own devicetree overlay fragment instead of
 * living here - see boards/eg800z.overlay, boards/le270.overlay, and
 * boards/nrf93m1_ext.overlay (the corresponding conf/modem_*.conf fragment
 * enables the matching Kconfig). They are mutually exclusive: uart21 is
 * shared between the EG800Z and LE270 fragments (only one modem is ever
 * populated on the DK at a time), and uart30 is used by the nRF93M1
 * external-wiring fragment.
 */
